{"translation":{"id":"pon_psa","name":"Kadede Kap Psam Akan","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pon-pdn","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pon-pdn","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"PSA","englishName":"Pohnpeian NT & Psalms, new alphabet","language":"pon","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"44957677e84100135c81bf32aea35989311fa14f1adce68493137d17ccec65be","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pon_psa/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10415,"languageName":"Pohnpeian","languageEnglishName":"Pohnpeian"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pon_psa","name":"Psalm","commonName":"Psalm","title":"PUK EN PSALM.","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8365887fd20c3baaaa24661fcb47a0a98df65a952380902c20e049eab55a5d82","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_psa/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_psa/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2460},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ME pweipwei o kin indinda nan mongiong i: Sota Kot. Sota katepa ’rail, o arail tiak meid sued; sota amen mia, me kin wia me mau.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ieowa kin irerong aramas akan sang nanlang, pwen masani, ma amen mia, me lolekong o rapaki Kot.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"A ir karos suedelar o karos sota kon ong, sota me kin wiada me mau, sota amen.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Irail karos me kin wiada mesued, sota ar lolekong, o me kin kawela nai aramas akan, lao medi kila, a re sota kin likwir ong Ieowa?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"I wasa re kin masak, pwe Kot kotikot ren kadaudok en me pung kan.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Komail kin kawela inong en me luet; aki Ieowa, me a kin kaporoporeki.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"O i men, sauas pan Israel en kodo sang nan Sion, o Ieowa en kotin lapwada sapwilim a salidi kan! I me Iakop pan insenemauki o Israel pan pereperenki.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pon_psa/PSA/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_psa/PSA/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pon_psa/PSA/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}